  "display_name": "Overcharge",
  "display_fullname": "Defender Ranged Beam Rifle Overcharge",
  "display_help": "You overcharge your Beam Rifle and release a massive blast of energy at a group of distant foes causing Extreme Energy damage, causing Minor Energy damage over time, reducing the defense of all affected foes and potentially stunning affected foes. If Overcharge strikes a target suffering from the Disintegrating effect they will be affected by a longer stun. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long",
